      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Avoca%2C_Arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Avoca sits in Benton County, perched at 1,362 feet on the Springfield Plateau of the Ozark Mountains.",
